    <service verb="get" noun="OperationPerformanceReport" allow-remote="false">
        <description>Each work center's OEE over the period, 7 days to now by default (OperationPerformanceReport):
            planned production time (its work hours less planned stops and outages), downtime (its unplanned stops and
            outages, unioned), run time (its machine runtime outside the downtime, else planned time less downtime),
            availability (run over planned time), performance (the ideal hours of the units counted over run time),
            quality (good over the units counted, each unit once and a rework run's output not again) and OEE, each Not
            calculable with its reason where its figures are missing; its machine and labor hours and its counts; the
            plant's figures over the calculable centers; and the downtime by reason (reasonCode filters it). A product
            narrows the units counted. Requires PRODUCTION_VIEW (PERMISSION_DENIED); refuses an organization or facility
            outside the user's scope (RECORD_UNAVAILABLE) and a period of more than a year or ending before it starts
            (PERIOD_TOO_LONG, PERIOD_INVALID). Answers its scope, as-of time, units, currencies and the partitions it
            could not read (complete false), and leaves money out without ACCOUNTING_VIEW (withheldText).</description>
